model {
  extend basalt.toolsGateway {
    metadata {
      constraint "App removal requires its external access-revocation acknowledgement before commit. An unavailable acknowledgement returns AppRemovalUnavailable with HTTP 503 while preserving the app and saved account links. A successful retry removes the app and keeps reusable accounts. Managed Cloud coverage refuses only its own pool at the external receiver and verifies rollback, recovery and complete organization teardown. The SDK error algebra is included in MCP Apps browser bundles; their generated bytes and content-hashed paths are regenerated together with pinned Bun after carry 0318, retaining its company-client guidance and the SDK removal error contracts."
    }
  }
}
